In refineqtl, linked QTL are scanned between flanking QTL positions or the ends of the chromosomes.  (The order of the QTL along a chromosome are not allowed to change.)

Regarding your second question: yes, for a 4-way cross in fitqtl, estimated QTL effects are relative to the AC group.

karl

